#---------------------------------- Content ---------------------------------#
#
# Room meshes load at runtime from GFX/map/*.rmesh (see MapSystem.EnsureTemplateMesh).
# Prop .x/.b3d assets require MGCB + assimp, which needs x64 Windows for the content
# pipeline. Regenerate entries with:
#   python files/cook_assets.py --src . --out Content/bin --mgcb --skip-mesh --skip-tex --skip-audio
